emergency.prompt:
An emergency has been called by {caller}.

**Reason:** {reason}

Verification is needed from at least **{approval_threshold}** other members of sudo level 1 or higher to confirm that this is indeed an emergency. Use the buttons below to approve or deny.

**{caller}, make sure all the details about the incident are clear: what is broken, what you have already tried, and any screenshots or logs that help.**

__The emergency ping is reserved for business production issues that are extremely time sensitive, not for homework or any other non-emergency issue.__

